        "commit_message": "```python\ndef f(n):\n    return \"a\" + \"\".join([\"x\"] * n)\n```\n\n`f(3)` returns `'ax'` instead of `'axxx'`. The same happens with `* 2`, `* 0` and tuples.\n\nThis fixes it and adds a test.",
        "commit_title": "Fix constant folding of \"...\" + \"\".join(seq * n) (GH-8021)",
