    "body": "```python\r\ndef f(n):\r\n    return \"a\" + \"\".join([\"x\"] * n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n`f(3)` returns `'ax'` instead of `'axxx'`. The same happens with `* 2`, `* 0` and tuples.\r\n\r\nThis fixes it and adds a test.",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-02T12:46:28Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8021#discussion_r4161043900"
